===Etymology===
{{dercat|sa|inc-pro|inh=1}}
From {{inh|sa|iir-pro|*wárčas||t=splendour, brilliance; vital power, energy}}. Cognate with {{cog|ae|𐬬𐬀𐬭𐬆𐬗𐬀𐬵|t=vital power; splendour, brilliance}}, {{cog|pal|𐫇𐫡𐫝|ts=warz|t=miraculous power}}.

